<title>NORWAY: Norway issues result of repo agreements.</title>
<headline>Norway issues result of repo agreements.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's central bank, Norges Bank, on Wednesday gave the following result for the repurchase agreements running from February 20 to March 4 issued a day earlier by Dutch auction.</p>
<p>Liquidity effect 20.02.97:   6,546 million crowns ($971.2 million)</p>
<p>Liquidity effect 04.03.97:   6,553 million crowns</p>
<p>The bank said bids with an interest rate of 3.20 percent and higher gave an allotment of 100 percent. All repo agreements will receive an interest rate of 3.20 percent, it said.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41 ($ = 6.739 Norwegian Crowns)</p>
